  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biparjoy Hits Fishermen of Keti Bundar!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyclone Biparjoy has left the already extremely vulnerable fishermen&apos;s families of Keti Bandar, Sindh,  paralyzed and abandoned - like fish washed on land.  They live without fulfillment of even their basic needs for food and shelter.  NHSD is distributing food rations in the area. Please help in reconstruction of fishing huts and distribution of food rations. NHSD has previously worked in Tharparkar during last year&apos;s floods. We wish to carry it forward to these vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
